# ---- 698 Geographic Information Systems II ----
H("698.d.1.A",3,"A student interested in mapping careers could find a job as a:","GIS technician or analyst",["pastry chef","fashion buyer","stage actor"],"GIS fields employ technicians and analysts.")
H("698.d.1.A",4,"Which job uses GIS to plan evacuation routes before storms?","emergency management planner",["bakery cashier","stage designer","hair stylist"],"Emergency planners rely on spatial data.")
